     "page_section_element_body": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "Use a Content Box to convey the key message of a page, such as values, themes, or essential takeaways. It works well in structured layouts where clarity and rhythm are essential, typically presented in groups using a Content Box Collection or a Content Box Strip. To preserve impact and avoid visual noise, it is best to include only a few Content Boxes in a single collection.",
